<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T said downgraded by DLJ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T said downgraded by DLJ.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin and Jenrette downgraded AT&amp;T Corp to market perform from outperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 5/8 to 50-7/8.  </p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
</text>
